{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 36, "timestamp": 1791954602, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "dumb"}, "title": "Quipu 0.13.0: governed memory in 60 seconds"}
[0.005104, "o", "Quipu 0.13.0: governed memory, using the released CLI.\r\nIllustrative fixtures in the public Quipu repository; isolated local store.\r\n"]
[0.006671, "o", "quipu 0.13.0\r\ngit_sha: ec3b707dc2976e579e634f276e752c7715a9ac99\r\ngit_dirty: false\r\n"]
[4.010735, "o", "\r\n$ quipu knot baseline.ttl --shapes memory.shapes.ttl --timestamp 2026-01-01T12:00:00Z --db memory.db \r\n"]
[4.284197, "o", "SHACL validation passed\r\n"]
[4.311962, "o", "knotted 4 facts from baseline.ttl (tx 1)\r\n"]
[4.318619, "o", "\r\n$ quipu read SELECT\\ \\?kind\\ WHERE\\ \\{\\ \\?decision\\ \\<https://example.org/memory/sourceKind\\>\\ \\?kind\\ \\} --db memory.db "]
[4.318635, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.320755, "o", "kind\r\n--------------------\r\n\"observed\"\r\n\r\n1 results\r\n"]
[8.323196, "o", "\r\nThe shape names the path and the allowed provenance tags.\r\n"]
[8.323311, "o", "\r\n$ quipu validate --shapes memory.shapes.ttl --data bad.ttl \r\n"]
[8.326117, "o", "invalid: 1 violation(s), 0 warning(s)\r\n  [Violation] https://example.org/memory/decision-2 -- In constraint not satisfied. Expected one of [Literal{StringLiteral { lexical_form: \"observed\", lang: None }}, Literal{StringLiteral { lexical_form: \"declared\", lang: None }}, Literal{StringLiteral { lexical_form: \"inferred\", lang: None }}] (path: https://example.org/memory/sourceKind)\r\n"]
[8.326455, "o", "Expected refusal (exit 1).\r\n"]
[8.326497, "o", "\r\n$ "]
[8.326521, "o", "quipu knot bad.ttl --shapes memory.shapes.ttl --timestamp 2026-01-02T12:00:00Z --db memory.db \r\n"]
[8.329852, "o", "SHACL validation failed: 1 violation(s)\r\n  Violation on https://example.org/memory/decision-2: In constraint not satisfied. Expected one of [Literal{StringLiteral { lexical_form: \"observed\", lang: None }}, Literal{StringLiteral { lexical_form: \"declared\", lang: None }}, Literal{StringLiteral { lexical_form: \"inferred\", lang: None }}]\r\n"]
[8.330177, "o", "Expected refusal (exit 1).\r\n"]
[8.330217, "o", "\r\nThe refused decision never entered the store:\r\n\r\n$ quipu read ASK\\ \\{\\ \\<https://example.org/memory/decision-2\\>\\ \\?p\\ \\?o\\ \\} --db memory.db \r\n"]
[8.33351, "o", "false\r\n"]
[12.343031, "o", "\r\nCorrect the tag and carry its source:\r\n\r\n$ quipu knot good.ttl --shapes memory.shapes.ttl --timestamp 2026-01-02T12:00:00Z --db memory.db \r\n"]
[12.348101, "o", "SHACL validation passed\r\n"]
[12.364212, "o", "knotted 4 facts from good.ttl (tx 2)\r\n"]
[12.368599, "o", "\r\n$ "]
[12.368659, "o", "quipu read SELECT\\ \\?kind\\ \\?source\\ WHERE\\ \\{\\ \\<https://example.org/memory/decision-2\\>\\ \\<https://example.org/memory/sourceKind\\>\\ \\?kind\\ \\;\\ \\<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom\\>\\ \\?source\\ \\} --db memory.db \r\n"]
[12.372238, "o", "kind\tsource\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n"]
[12.372291, "o", "\"declared\"\thttps://example.org/memory/example-review\r\n\r\n1 results\r\n"]
[16.375289, "o", "\r\nBefore the second decision:\r\n\r\n$ "]
[16.375377, "o", "quipu unravel --valid-at 2026-01-02T00:00:00Z --db memory.db \r\n"]
[16.377343, "o", "https://example.org/memory/decision-1  http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type  https://example.org/memory/Decision  [2026-01-01T12:00:00Z -> inf]\r\nhttps://example.org/memory/decision-1  https://example.org/memory/text  Keep the release reversible  [2026-01-01T12:00:00Z -> inf]\r\nhttps://example.org/memory/decision-1  https://example.org/memory/sourceKind  observed  [2026-01-01T12:00:00Z -> inf]\r\nhttps://example.org/memory/decision-1  http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom  https://example.org/memory/release-check  [2026-01-01T12:00:00Z -> inf]\r\n\r\n4 facts\r\n"]
[20.379572, "o", "\r\nAfter it:\r\n\r\n$ "]
[20.379664, "o", "quipu unravel --valid-at 2026-01-03T00:00:00Z --db memory.db \r\n"]
[20.382972, "o", "https://example.org/memory/decision-1  http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type  https://example.org/memory/Decision  [2026-01-01T12:00:00Z -> inf]\r\nhttps://example.org/memory/decision-1  https://example.org/memory/text  Keep the release reversible  [2026-01-01T12:00:00Z -> inf]\r\nhttps://example.org/memory/decision-1  https://example.org/memory/sourceKind  observed  [2026-01-01T12:00:00Z -> inf]\r\nhttps://example.org/memory/decision-1  http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom  https://example.org/memory/release-check  [2026-01-01T12:00:00Z -> inf]\r\nhttps://example.org/memory/decision-2  http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type  https://example.org/memory/Decision  [2026-01-02T12:00:00Z -> inf]\r\nhttps://example.org/memory/decision-2  https://example.org/memory/text  Require a reproducible example  [2026-01-02T12:00:00Z -> inf]\r\nhttps://example.org/memory/decision-2  https://example.org/memory/sourceKind  declared  [2026-01-02T12:00:00Z -> inf]\r\nhttps://example.org/memory/decision-2  http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom  https://example.org/memory/example-review  [2026-01-02T12:00:00Z -> inf]\r\n\r\n8 facts\r\n"]
[60.391361, "o", "\r\nRefused writes stay out. Accepted facts retain their valid-time and source.\r\n"]
